@startuml otcp_sequence_share
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 100
actor Owner
actor Guest
participant DeckStore as Store
participant ShareService as Share
participant Supabase as SB
Owner -> Store : save deck
Store -> SB : upsert deck (RLS)
SB --> Store : ok
Owner -> Share : create share
Share -> SB : insert opaque token
SB --> Share : token
Share --> Owner : /otcp/share/<token>
Guest -> Share : open token
Share -> SB : lookup token
SB --> Share : deck id (read-only)
Share --> Guest : read-only deck view
Owner -> Share : revoke
Share -> SB : invalidate token
Guest -> Share : reload
Share --> Guest : not found
@enduml
